        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Cross <b>County/Region:</b> Møn + Lolland-Falster <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>5</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 54.699475 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 11.786213<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Scandinavia/Denmark/thumb/cl_IMG_2727x.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Wayside Roguish Cross - erected by Royal Decree in 1533.. For centuries the peasants of Frejlev have owned the forests along Guldborgsund. In 1533 their rights were violated by the royal count of Ålh...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
