<Placemark>   <name>Rispebjerg Soltempel</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Temple <b>County/Region:</b> Bornholm <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>4</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 55.025612 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 15.010848<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Scandinavia/Denmark/thumb/knc_IMG_3461.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Sun temple and Fortress on the island of Bornholm. The site Ripebjerg contains a number of ancient wooden circles from about 2,800 BC. Traces of the original wooden poles have been found and recently ...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
